# Textures the Godot importer extracts from a GLB as <model>_<n>.png sidecars.
# They are regenerated by every `--import` (CI runs one before anything else),
# and the 2026-09-12 drop's baked texture sets made them 447 files / 365 MB.
# The brand icons are real files, not sidecars.
game/assets/**/*_[0-9]*.png
!game/assets/brand/*.png
